WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:02.651
Welcome back to WODDI Institute.

00:02.991 --> 00:10.872
In the next few minutes, I will show you exactly how to continue your learning from where you stopped. Follow along on your phone.

00:11.672 --> 00:14.862
Step one. Open WODDI Institute.

00:15.202 --> 00:24.185
Type woddiinstitute.com into your browser, or tap the WODDI icon if you added it to your home screen. Only use official WODDI links.

00:24.985 --> 00:27.493
Step two. Tap Sign in.

00:27.833 --> 00:34.065
Use the same account you registered with. If you joined with Google, tap Continue with Google.

00:34.405 --> 00:39.504
Otherwise, choose Email or Phone Number, then type your details and your password.

00:39.844 --> 00:45.641
Please do not create a new account. Your progress is saved in the one you already have.

00:45.981 --> 00:55.628
Forgotten your password? Tap Forgot password and follow the steps. If you are still stuck, our support team can help you get back in.

00:56.428 --> 00:59.495
Step three. This is your home screen.

00:59.835 --> 01:09.570
The pink card shows the phase you are in, and how far you have come. Here, half of the Rooting modules are done. Nothing has been lost.

01:10.370 --> 01:13.016
Step four. Know your path.

01:13.356 --> 01:23.037
Every learner starts with the Rooting Phase, then Blueprint, then the Course Hub, where the practical courses are. Each stage unlocks the next.

01:23.377 --> 01:30.010
WGMN and WNNN learners each have their own courses on the same path.

01:30.810 --> 01:33.592
Step five. Tap Continue.

01:33.932 --> 01:42.511
Modules you have finished are ticked in green. Your next one is marked Current. Tap it, and your lesson opens.

01:42.851 --> 01:50.959
Lessons are short. Most take about ten minutes. Read at your own pace, and aim to finish one today.

01:51.759 --> 01:54.707
Step six. Answer the Quick Check.

01:55.047 --> 02:04.138
Read the question carefully. If you are unsure, scroll back through the lesson first. Then tap Submit and Mark Complete.

02:04.938 --> 02:07.985
Step seven. Watch your progress grow.

02:08.325 --> 02:14.513
Each module you complete moves your progress forward and earns Growth Points, which you can see on your home screen.

02:15.313 --> 02:21.693
Prefer another language? Open More, then Settings, and change the App language.

02:22.033 --> 02:28.731
In the Course Hub, many lessons also have a Listen button, so you can learn while you cook, travel or rest.

02:29.531 --> 02:32.198
Step eight. Choose a course.

02:32.538 --> 02:40.771
Once Rooting and Blueprint are complete, the Course Hub opens. Find a course that matches your goal, and tap Start course.

02:41.571 --> 02:44.456
Step nine. Earn your certificate.

02:44.796 --> 02:53.653
Finish the course and pass its final quiz, and your certificate is issued. Anyone can scan its QR code to confirm it is real.

02:54.453 --> 02:56.869
Need help? Ask early.

02:57.209 --> 03:06.313
Tap Mentor to ask your AI Mentor anything, by typing or by voice. Or open More, then Support, and our team will help you.

03:07.113 --> 03:08.411
That is all it takes.

03:08.751 --> 03:16.610
Open WODDI Institute, sign in, tap Continue, and finish one lesson today. Your next step is waiting.

03:17.410 --> 03:22.807
WODDI Institute. Learning for growth. Knowledge for life.
